<figcaption><p id="P35">Regression of potencies (ED<sub>50</sub> values in mg/kg) in the locomotor activity and drug discrimination assays for 37 cannabinoid compounds tested in our laboratory.</p></figcaption></figure></section><section id="S11" class="ack"><h2 class="pmc_sec_title">Acknowledgments</h2>
